 "intro_zh": "西塘古镇地势平坦，河流密布，呈现“桥多、弄多、廊棚多”的景观特色。作为中国首批历史文化名镇、江南六大古镇之一，这里历史悠久，是古代吴越文化的发祥地之一。曾获世界遗产保护杰出成就奖，并被国家文物局列入中国世界文化遗产预备名单。",
 "intro_en": "Xitang Ancient Town has a flat terrain and dense rivers, presenting a landscape with \"many bridges, lanes, and sheds\". As one of the first batch of historical and cultural towns in China and one of the six ancient towns in Jiangnan, it has a long history and is one of the birthplaces of ancient Wuyue culture. It has won the Outstanding Achievement Award for World Heritage Protection and has been included in China's World Cultural Heritage Preparatory List by the State Administration of Cultural Heritage.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
